# Orzhov Basilica's enters trigger uses the stack (CR 603.3): with it waiting, Bot1 taps the Plains for {W} in response, then the
# trigger resolves and Bot1 returns that tapped Plains to its hand - the mana already made stays in the pool. The Plains is
# back in the hand untapped (a new object, CR 400.7) and the Basilica, which entered tapped, stays.

[Bot1 Deck]
Plains
Orzhov Basilica
Plains x5
Plains x10

[Bot2 Deck]
Swamp x15

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Plains.Play
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Hand.Orzhov Basilica.Play
Bot1.Battlefield.Plains.Activate
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Choose(Plains)
? Bot1.Mana = {W}
? Bot1.Battlefield = Orzhov Basilica
? Bot1.Hand.Count = 7

[Expect]
Bot1.Battlefield.Orzhov Basilica.Tapped = true
